//nn = neural network
//use mouse to tell nn the target position
//nn trained on data generated by https://compute.toys/view/3342
//the nn can only control what you control in https://compute.toys/view/3222
//this version is better because it tells the nn the target position of whole pendulum body
//instead of only telling the nn the target position of the pendulum tip
//i forgot to add high speed movements to the training data so
//the nn strugles to control high speed movements, when pendulum tip moves very fast

